{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）早上9時21分，新蒲崗爵祿街百勝工廠大廈一單位的後門玻璃被打爛，內有搜掠痕跡，懷疑遭爆竊，職員報警求助。人員接報到場調查，實際損失仍有待點算。據知，涉事單位是9樓一間投資公司。</p><figure><img alt=\"據知，涉事9樓單位是一間投資公司。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192417592011395072275418.jpeg/Q6kLFbfPQ-u4im1YnBoF9ocx25p5C65JzOYjhObmI4Q\"/><figcaption>據知，涉事9樓單位是一間投資公司。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192417589494681600396478.jpeg/9_a8wEFgwCNcCtSgTTordPTNBrii4Tq0YKukRUqrpEU\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事單位後門玻璃門被破壞，內有搜掠痕跡。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192417586571120640739250.jpeg/wUtAAv8Q5Jf0uWMid_s8bfC0GkkcUj5HXN2siXbdrIk\"/><figcaption>涉事單位後門玻璃門被破壞，內有搜掠痕跡。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為新蒲崗爵祿街百勝工廠大廈一單位。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192417595023036416496502.jpeg/0oZhCMPOXSnDNJ__kEJHWqGqqW1axzDcy6NZveGjWb0\"/><figcaption>現場為新蒲崗爵祿街百勝工廠大廈一單位。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T02:41:14.378911+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:16:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:42.016581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:38:28.487178+00:00","content_hash":"dcbd62b9993b5e9c1e0112960a69ea7b33aa865e0f860b1ce5177ba08f599c04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}